url: 'https://www.yempik.com/mail-gateway'
abstract: 'Yempik Mail Gateway is an open-source Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that puts Gmail, Microsoft 365 and Zoho Mail behind one tool surface for AI agents. It adds draft-first delivery, per-identity daily send limits, idempotent sends, reconciliation of uncertain sends, audit logging and a global kill switch.'
keywords:
